# Artifacts directory

When the user says **"the artifacts directory"** (or similar), follow the
canonical **`~/.cursor/skills/ARTIFACTS.md`** policy and resolve the path with
its synced helper. This Cursor rule only supplies the always-on trigger and
runtime path; the canonical policy defines scopes, naming, precedence, and
deduplication.
